{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54256","headline":"赠前翰林待诏王敬傲（题拟） · 李山甫","name":"赠前翰林待诏王敬傲（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽兰绿水耿清音，叹息先生枉用心。\n世上几时曾好古，人前何必苦沾襟。\n（《太平广记》卷二○三引《耳目记》引）（按：《全唐诗》卷六四三收山甫七律《赠弹琴李处士》，前四句与此首较相似，但首句完全不同，另三句也颇有异文，故仍录出。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李山甫","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54256.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54256","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}